# Thopter Fabricator: "Whenever you draw your second card each turn" makes a 1/1 flying Thopter (CR 121.2, 603.2). Cast off
# Black Lotus on turn 1. Bot2's own second card on turn 2 (Opt) gives Bot1 nothing. On turn 3 the draw step's card is Bot1's
# first (no Thopter), the first Opt's card is the second (one Thopter), and the second Opt's is the third (no more).

